This looks like something along the lines of

ggplot(data, aes(x = K1, y = K2, color = grosor)) +
  geom_point() +
  facet_grid(var1 ~ var2)

Where grosor is a factor, var1 is a factor with levels 1 and 2, var2 is a factor with levels 5 and 6. You can check out the references at https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/

Cheers,
Roman

